  "result": "Quick status: I searched the archive and read the closest tickets. Several earlier requests ask for the same thing, so I'm finishing my answer now.\n\n```json\n{\"seen_before\": true, \"matches\": [\"PowerToys#47355\", \"PowerToys#48389\", \"PowerToys#47865\"], \"answer\": \"This feature request has been filed before. The Power Display tray icon doesn't match the other Windows system tray icons, and users want a monochrome icon like the one Twinkle Tray uses. PowerToys#47355 asks for monochrome tray icons for every PowerToys tray app. One comment there asks for a brightness-style icon like Twinkle Tray's for Power Display. PowerToys#48389 asks for a monochrome option for the other PowerToys tray apps, Power Display included. PowerToys#47865 asks for a clearer, Twinkle Tray-style brightness icon for Power Display. In that ticket a maintainer ([user]) asked whether the icon needs improving. I found no fix or release for this in the archive. For now, Power Display only has its current tray icon. Please add your use case, and a 👍, to those tickets rather than opening a new one. Only the main PowerToys tray icon currently has the setting 'Show a monochrome icon that matches the Windows theme'.\"}\n```",
